    "allowed_change": "Wrap user-provided text within the MCP/Skill product surface, including Skill names, descriptions, file paths and installation status. Preserve original casing of all library card names. Reverting only these two CSS changes reproduces every prior hash. Valid Skill fixtures and DOM dimensions cover mobile and desktop without screenshots.",
